      <div><p class="uce-eyebrow">US B2B lead generation / A campaign you can follow</p><h1 id="uce-title">See how a US calling campaign becomes a <span>qualified sales meeting.</span></h1><p class="uce-lead">Follow the account selection, opening conversation and decisions behind one campaign. See what reaches the salesperson when a buyer agrees to meet.</p><div class="uce-actions"><a href="#uce-brief" class="uce-button">Explore the Campaign <span aria-hidden="true">↘</span></a><a href="https://calendly.com/hello-callteam/new-meeting" class="uce-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-uce-booking>Let’s Build Your US Calling Campaign <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><p class="uce-small uce-hero-note">A free worked example. Read it, explore the buyer replies and take the campaign brief.</p><p class="uce-byline">Written by <a href="{{ authors.harjSingh.url }}">{{ authors.harjSingh.name }}</a> · <time datetime="2026-10-16">October 16, 2026</time></p></div>
